# {{form of|possessive case|men|lang=en|nodot=a}}: [[belong]]ing to [[some]] or [[all]] [[male]] [[human]]s.
# {{short for|men’s room|lang=en|nodot=a}}: a [[lavatory]] [[intend]]ed for [[use]] by [[men]].
# A men's [[department]]: an [[area]] [[sell]]ing [[clothing]] for [[adult]] [[male]]s in a [[department store]].

====Usage notes====
Distinguished from {{term|man's}}, which as a [[collective noun]], refers to all [[mankind]] in every gender. Not to be used as a form of {{term|men}}, the simple plural.

